  - question: "John Jackson's memoir \"Please Go to Hell\" (see \"Digging for the Truth\") gives the institution as \"Roselawn Sanitarium,\" not the Colorado State Insane Asylum, Pueblo. Is this a separate facility, or does the memoir conflate the institution with somewhere else?"
    priority: "low"
